# Intentionally inert. Caddy treats an `import` glob that matches zero files as a
# hard configuration error, which would crash-loop the proxy - and the proxy
# going down takes every instance with it. This file guarantees the glob in
# ../Caddyfile always matches at least one thing.
#
# dx writes real instance routes alongside it as <slug>.caddy. Do not delete.
(dx_placeholder) {
	respond "dx placeholder" 200
}
